OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Wagner
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod marks Sir Charles
OL,6,     GMackerras's centenary exploring
OL,7,     Ghis recording of the prologues
OL,8,     Gand preludes to some of Wagner's
OL,9,     Gbest-loved music dramas.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc Trelawny continues the
OL,12,     Gcelebration of Charles Mackerras
OL,13,     Gwith Czech conductor Jakub Hrusa,
OL,14,     Gwinner of the very first Sir
OL,15,     GCharles Mackerras Award plus live
OL,16,     Gmusic in the studio.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,20,     Gtoday celebrating the legacy of
OL,21,     Gthe conductor Charles Mackerras.
